  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://nyako.gay/assets/veindigging.png\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>连锁挖掘</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>连锁挖掘</strong>是一款让玩家实现连锁开采功能的模组——就像VeinMiner那样！本模组的独特之处在于<strong>客户端可选择性安装</strong>，这意味着<strong>服务器上的所有玩家只需潜行就能触发连锁挖掘</strong>，而安装了模组的玩家还能使用<strong>专属快捷键</strong>！此外，当工具即将损坏时，连锁挖掘会自动停止。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>服务器管理员须知：</strong></p><p>提供以下白名单与黑名单标签：</p><ul>\n<li>veindigging:bind_blacklist</li>\n<li>veindigging:bind_whitelist</li>\n<li>veindigging:shift_blacklist</li>\n<li>veindigging:shift_whitelist</li>\n<li>veindigging:global_blacklist</li>\n<li>veindigging:global_whitelist</li>\n</ul><p>默认仅启用潜行白名单（包含<strong>原木、树叶、矿石和荧石</strong>），确保玩家潜行时不会误连锁其他方块。建议不要关闭潜行白名单功能。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/NyakoFox/VeinDigging/\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/github_vector.svg\" alt=\"GitHub下载\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/veindigging\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge下载\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fveindigging\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth下载\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/fabric_vector.svg\" alt=\"支持Fabric\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/quilt_vector.svg\" alt=\"支持Quilt\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/unsupported/forge_vector.svg\" alt=\"不支持Forge\"><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/fabric-api_vector.svg\" alt=\"需Fabric API\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/cloth-config-api_vector.svg\" alt=\"需Cloth Config API\"></a></p><h1 style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://patreon.com/nyakofox\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/kofi-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"在Ko-fi支持我们\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"在Patreon支持我们\" width=\"180\" height=\"56\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">支持者可提前获取模组测试版，部分模组还享有专属福利。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><em>作为无法从事常规工作的独立开发者，您的每一份支持都意义非凡。🩷&nbsp;</em></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
